spec GuardedProfileSave.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK IntendedSnapshot NoSilentSuccess SlotFirst AtMostOnce
check PROPERTIES ConfirmedSlotStays ReadOnlyRecovery NoForeignRecovery NoWrongActiveWrite EventuallyFinished
reach BothSaved | slots=1 edits=0
reach SlotCommittedReplyLost | slots=1 edits=0
reach BootCommittedReplyLost | slots=1 edits=0
reach GuardRejectsSlotEdit | slots=2 edits=2
reach GuardRejectsBootEdit | slots=2 edits=2
reach ForeignDuringRecovery | slots=1 edits=0
run slots=1 edits=0 | Slots=1 Edits=0
run slots=2 edits=2 | Slots=2 Edits=2
run slots=32 edits=2 | Slots=32 Edits=2
